    prov:value "{\"messages\": [\"ChatMessage(role=<MessageRole.SYSTEM: 'system'>, content=[{'type': 'text', 'text': 'You are an expert assistant who can solve any task using tool calls. You will be given a task to solve as best you can.\\\\nTo do so, you have been given access to some tools.\\\\n\\\\nThe tool call you write is an action: after the tool is executed, you will get the result of the tool call as an \\\"observation\\\".\\\\nThis Action/Observation can repeat N times, you should take several steps when needed.\\\\n\\\\nYou can use the result of the previous action as input for the next action.\\\\nThe observation will always be a string: it can represent a file, like \\\"image_1.jpg\\\".\\\\nThen you can use it as input for the next action. You can do it for instance as follows:\\\\n\\\\nObservation: \\\"image_1.jpg\\\"\\\\n\\\\nAction:\\\\n{\\\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"image_transformer\\\",\\\\n  \\\"arguments\\\": {\\\"image\\\": \\\"image_1.jpg\\\"}\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nTo provide the final answer to the task, use an action blob with \\\"name\\\": \\\"final_answer\\\" tool. It is the only way to complete the task, else you will be stuck on a loop. So your final output should look like this:\\\\nAction:\\\\n{\\\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"final_answer\\\",\\\\n  \\\"arguments\\\": {\\\"answer\\\": \\\"insert your final answer here\\\"}\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nHere are a few examples using notional tools:\\\\n---\\\\nTask: \\\"Generate an image of the oldest person in this document.\\\"\\\\n\\\\nAction:\\\\n{\\\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"document_qa\\\",\\\\n  \\\"arguments\\\": {\\\"document\\\": \\\"document.pdf\\\", \\\"question\\\": \\\"Who is the oldest person mentioned?\\\"}\\\\n}\\\\nObservation: \\\"The oldest person in the document is John Doe, a 55 year old lumberjack living in Newfoundland.\\\"\\\\n\\\\nAction:\\\\n{\\\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"image_generator\\\",\\\\n  \\\"arguments\\\": {\\\"prompt\\\": \\\"A portrait of John Doe, a 55-year-old man living in Canada.\\\"}\\\\n}\\\\nObservation: \\\"image.png\\\"\\\\n\\\\nAction:\\\\n{\\\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"final_answer\\\",\\\\n  \\\"arguments\\\": \\\"image.png\\\"\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\nTask: \\\"What is the result of the following operation: 5 + 3 + 1294.678?\\\"\\\\n\\\\nAction:\\\\n{\\\\n    \\\"name\\\": \\\"python_interpreter\\\",\\\\n    \\\"arguments\\\": {\\\"code\\\": \\\"5 + 3 + 1294.678\\\"}\\\\n}\\\\nObservation: 1302.678\\\\n\\\\nAction:\\\\n{\\\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"final_answer\\\",\\\\n  \\\"arguments\\\": \\\"1302.678\\\"\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\nTask: \\\"Which city has the highest population , Guangzhou or Shanghai?\\\"\\\\n\\\\nAction:\\\\n{\\\\n    \\\"name\\\": \\\"web_search\\\",\\\\n    \\\"arguments\\\": \\\"Population Guangzhou\\\"\\\\n}\\\\nObservation: [\\\\'Guangzhou has a population of 15 million inhabitants as of 2021.\\\\']\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nAction:\\\\n{\\\\n    \\\"name\\\": \\\"web_search\\\",\\\\n    \\\"arguments\\\": \\\"Population Shanghai\\\"\\\\n}\\\\nObservation: \\\\'26 million (2019)\\\\'\\\\n\\\\nAction:\\\\n{\\\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"final_answer\\\",\\\\n  \\\"arguments\\\": \\\"Shanghai\\\"\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nAbove example were using notional tools that might not exist for you. You only have access to these tools:\\\\n- read_note: Read the shared note about a city.\\\\n    Takes inputs: {\\\\'city\\\\': {\\\\'type\\\\': \\\\'string\\\\', \\\\'description\\\\': \\\\'The city.\\\\'}}\\\\n    Returns an output of type: string\\\\n- final_answer: Provides a final answer to the given problem.\\\\n    Takes inputs: {\\\\'answer\\\\': {\\\\'type\\\\': \\\\'any\\\\', \\\\'description\\\\': \\\\'The final answer to the problem\\\\'}}\\\\n    Returns an output of type: any\\\\n- send_brief: Send the brief to a recipient.\\\\n    Takes inputs: {\\\\'text\\\\': {\\\\'type\\\\': \\\\'string\\\\', \\\\'description\\\\': \\\\'The brief.\\\\'}, \\\\'to\\\\': {\\\\'type\\\\': \\\\'string\\\\', \\\\'description\\\\': \\\\'The recipient.\\\\'}}\\\\n    Returns an output of type: string\\\\nYou write two-sentence briefs about a city. Always call read_note for the city first, then give the brief as your final answer.\\\\n\\\\nHere are the rules you should always follow to solve your task:\\\\n1. ALWAYS provide a tool call, else you will fail.\\\\n2. Always use the right arguments for the tools. Never use variable names as the action arguments, use the value instead.\\\\n3. Call a tool only when needed: do not call the search agent if you do not need information, try to solve the task yourself. If no tool call is needed, use final_answer tool to return your answer.\\\\n4. Never re-do a tool call that you previously did with the exact same parameters.\\\\n\\\\nNow Begin!'}], tool_calls=None, raw=None, token_usage=None)\", \"ChatMessage(role=<MessageRole.USER: 'user'>, content=[{'type': 'text', 'text': \\\"New task:\\\\nYou're a helpful agent named 'writer'.\\\\nYou have been submitted this task by your manager.\\\\n---\\\\nTask:\\\\nWrite a two-sentence brief about Lisbon based on the following information: 1. Lisbon is the capital of Portugal and is located on the Tagus estuary. 2. The current weather in Lisbon is 21°C with a clear sky.\\\\n---\\\\nYou're helping your manager solve a wider task: so make sure to not provide a one-line answer, but give as much information as possible to give them a clear understanding of the answer.\\\\n\\\\nYour final_answer WILL HAVE to contain these parts:\\\\n### 1. Task outcome (short version):\\\\n### 2. Task outcome (extremely detailed version):\\\\n### 3. Additional context (if relevant):\\\\n\\\\nPut all these in your final_answer tool, everything that you do not pass as an argument to final_answer will be lost.\\\\nAnd even if your task resolution is not successful, please return as much context as possible, so that your manager can act upon this feedback.\\\"}], tool_calls=None, raw=None, token_usage=None)\", \"ChatMessage(role=<MessageRole.TOOL_CALL: 'tool-call'>, content=[{'type': 'text', 'text': \\\"Calling tools:\\\\n[{'id': 'call_CADF6A2DEAC549F988ADB83F', 'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'read_note', 'arguments': {'city': 'Lisbon'}}}]\\\"}], tool_calls=None, raw=None, token_usage=None)\", \"ChatMessage(role=<MessageRole.TOOL_RESPONSE: 'tool-response'>, content=[{'type': 'text', 'text': \\\"Observation:\\\\n### 1. Task outcome (short version): 12. Lisbon is the capital of Portugal and is located on the Tagus estuary. ### 2. Task outcome (extremely detailed version): Lisbon is the capital city of Portugal. It is a major European city and is strategically located on the Tagus estuary, which provides significant maritime importance. ### 3. Additional context (if relevant): The city's location on the estuary has historically played a crucial role in its development as a major trading and maritime hub.\\\"}], tool_calls=None, raw=None, token_usage=None)\", \"ChatMessage(role=<MessageRole.TOOL_CALL: 'tool-call'>, content=[{'type': 'text', 'text': \\\"Calling tools:\\\\n[{'id': 'call_95DAD7DF2F2F4C73B4ECC2B9', 'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'final_answer', 'arguments': {'answer': '### 1. Task outcome (short version): Lisbon is the capital of Portugal, located on the Tagus estuary, with current weather of 21°C and a clear sky. ### 2. Task outcome (extremely detailed version): Lisbon serves as the capital of Portugal and is situated on the Tagus estuary. Currently, the weather in the city is 21°C under a clear sky. ### 3. Additional context (if relevant): The information provided includes both geographical location and current meteorological conditions.'}}}]\\\"}], tool_calls=None, raw=None, token_usage=None)\", \"ChatMessage(role=<MessageRole.TOOL_RESPONSE: 'tool-response'>, content=[{'type': 'text', 'text': 'Observation:\\\\n### 1. Task outcome (short version): Lisbon is the capital of Portugal, located on the Tagus estuary, with current weather of 21°C and a clear sky. ### 2. Task outcome (extremely detailed version): Lisbon serves as the capital of Portugal and is situated on the Tagus estuary. Currently, the weather in the city is 21°C under a clear sky. ### 3. Additional context (if relevant): The information provided includes both geographical location and current meteorological conditions.'}], tool_calls=None, raw=None, token_usage=None)\", \"ChatMessage(role=<MessageRole.TOOL_RESPONSE: 'tool-response'>, content=[{'type': 'text', 'text': \\\"Call id: call_95DAD7DF2F2F4C73B4ECC2B9\\\\nError:\\\\nCheck review failed with error: the draft failed review: the first draft is always sent back for revision. Revise it\\\\nNow let's retry: take care not to repeat previous errors! If you have retried several times, try a completely different approach.\\\\n\\\"}], tool_calls=None, raw=None, token_usage=None)\", \"ChatMessage(role=<MessageRole.TOOL_CALL: 'tool-call'>, content=[{'type': 'text', 'text': 'Calling tools:\\\\n[{\\\\'id\\\\': \\\\'call_92EF334B596142748861D4B3\\\\', \\\\'type\\\\': \\\\'function\\\\', \\\\'function\\\\': {\\\\'name\\\\': \\\\'final_answer\\\\', \\\\'arguments\\\\': {\\\\'answer\\\\': \\\"### 1. Task outcome (short version): Lisbon is the capital of Portugal, situated on the Tagus estuary, currently enjoying 21°C weather with clear skies. ### 2. Task outcome (extremely detailed version): As the capital of Portugal, Lisbon is strategically positioned along the Tagus estuary. The current meteorological conditions in the city are highly pleasant, featuring a temperature of 21°C and a clear, cloudless sky. ### 3. Additional context (if relevant): The brief incorporates both the city\\\\'s primary geographical status and its current weather conditions as requested.\\\"}}}]'}], tool_calls=None, raw=None, token_usage=None)\", \"ChatMessage(role=<MessageRole.TOOL_RESPONSE: 'tool-response'>, content=[{'type': 'text', 'text': \\\"Observation:\\\\n### 1. Task outcome (short version): Lisbon is the capital of Portugal, situated on the Tagus estuary, currently enjoying 21°C weather with clear skies. ### 2. Task outcome (extremely detailed version): As the capital of Portugal, Lisbon is strategically positioned along the Tagus estuary. The current meteorological conditions in the city are highly pleasant, featuring a temperature of 21°C and a clear, cloudless sky. ### 3. Additional context (if relevant): The brief incorporates both the city's primary geographical status and its current weather conditions as requested.\\\"}], tool_calls=None, raw=None, token_usage=None)\", \"ChatMessage(role=<MessageRole.USER: 'user'>, content=[{'type': 'text', 'text': 'New task:\\\\nSend this brief to client with send_brief, then answer with the file path:\\\\nLisbon is the capital of Portugal, situated on the Tagus estuary, currently enjoying 21°C weather with clear skies.'}], tool_calls=None, raw=None, token_usage=None)\"], \"stop_sequences\": [\"Observation:\", \"Calling tools:\"], \"response_format\": null, \"tools_to_call_from\": [\"<smolagents.tools.tool.<locals>.SimpleTool object at 0x7f5550750110>\", \"<smolagents.default_tools.FinalAnswerTool object at 0x7f554eb03020>\", \"<smolagents.tools.tool.<locals>.SimpleTool object at 0x7f554eb034a0>\"], \"kwargs\": {}}" .

